# Base URL of the versioned API. Leave unset in development: the Vite dev
# server proxies /api and /health to http://localhost:3000.
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so for a production build set it before
# `pnpm build`. Do NOT put API keys here: VITE_* values are public. Users sign
# in with their own key in the browser.
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
